// The CLOSED vocabulary of process topics.  A topic that is an unambiguous
// consequence of the record type (gasLiquidEquilibrium -> gasDissolution,
// ionExchangeEquilibrium -> ionExchange) is DERIVED, never written by hand.
topicVocabulary
(
    acidBase
    complexation
    hydrolysis
    gasDissolution
    mineralDissolution
    ionExchange
    redox
    waterDissociation
);
